{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ef6b1637-154f-8529-bd37-3fdb67adeff3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:16:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Patrick Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about the water on Marsh Street? Like, in The Point? It's at 99 Marsh Street, that's my mom's place, I'm calling for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 99 Marsh. What's going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water is totally over the curb and across the whole sidewalk. It's been like that since the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, so two days ago, and it's still sitting there? And this morning a delivery truck got stuck in it. Like, the driver had to wait for a tow guy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:12:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Stuck how, like the wheels sank in or it stalled out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:12:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It stalled, I think? He drove right into it because you can't tell how deep it is, and then it just died. He was pretty mad. Honestly I don't blame him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Okay, I'm writing down, water over the curb, across the sidewalk, 99 Marsh Street, vehicle stalled. Is the water coming up out of a storm drain, do you know, or is it just pooling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:04-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it's pooling, I think? I can't really see a drain, it's all under water. But my mom's neighbor was out there and she said it happens every big rain. Like every single one. So that's the thing, it's not a surprise, you know? Why is nobody fixing it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so it's a repeat spot. That's helpful to put in the notes. Is the water getting near the house, or into the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in the house, no. It's the street and sidewalk. But my mom has to walk through it to get to her car, and she's, like, not going to do that. So she's kind of stuck too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. [pause] Sorry, I'm just typing this in. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I can hear you, but, sorry, my phone keeps switching to some weaker network? It's, like, doing it again right now. If I cut out that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Did you say you're on a landline or a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm on my mom's landline, but it's like crackly and the, um, [line breaks up] sorry, the other one is my cell, it keeps doing the weaker network thing when I'm walking around. I'm at her place now though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha, so this one should be fine. Let me read it back. Water over the curb and across the sidewalk at 99 Marsh Street in The Point, since the storm over the weekend, a delivery truck stalled in it this morning, and neighbors say it floods every heavy rain. Sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, totally. That's it. And I just, like, really want somebody to come look at it? Because it's been two days. The rain stopped Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I hear you. Crews are stretched after a storm like that, but I'll send this over to the drainage folks as a repeat problem so it's flagged. I can't tell you exactly when they'll get out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can somebody call me back when it's done? Like, when it's cleared or whatever?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's a good number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-five-one, got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Patrick Dolan. D-O-L-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Patrick Dolan, 401-555-0151, call back once it's taken care of. All set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thanks. I mean, I appreciate it, I just hope it actually happens this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:15:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the system now. Take care, Patrick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T11:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
